      en: ["The mission was established as part of a 20th-century Catholic expansion.", "It hosted one of the first formal schools in the northern interior.", "The church building is a prominent example of colonial-era religious design.", "The mission remained operational throughout the turbulent years of the 1960s.", "It currently serves as a hub for community-based agricultural training.", "Many high-ranking government officials are alumni of the mission school."]
