      en: ["Fulacunda served as the administrative capital of the Quínara district.", "The ruins represent a period of intense colonial expansion in the south.", "Key structures include the old post office and colonial school house.", "The town was a primary collection point for local palm oil production.", "Its decline began after the capital was moved to its current location.", "The site is often visited by researchers studying colonial urban history."]
